abstract: >
  A reproducible `targets` (R) pipeline for Study 2 (agronomic management --
  fertilisation source and crop residue treatments, and their interaction
  with position relative to vertical PV panels) of a PhD research programme
  on vertical agrivoltaics at Aarhus University, Foulum (Value4Farm
  project). Reads raw and intermediate data from the companion
  V4F_agrivoltaics repository (github.com/kamaulindhardt/V4F_agrivoltaics),
  which also holds the Study 1 (microclimate/DAISY modelling) and Study 3
  (whole-system) analyses. See README.md and docs/ for details.
